    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be kind, but it's hard to see the point in \"reconnecting\" when the body just keeps failing. the doctors say i'm stable, but stable just means i'm lingering. i'm tired of just... waiting for things to break further. it feels like i've lost all my agency. i have no control over how i age or how i fade.",
